  (text "WINDLASS CONTROLLER  integrated rev 1.0   Fabrication package prepared; not ordered.\nGrounds that are NOT joined on this PCB:\n  GND      board 12 V return, ESP32, coil drivers, USB shield network\n  UP_RET   UP sense opto return only\n  DN_RET   DOWN sense opto return only\n  REED_RET reed isolator field ground only\n  GND_CAN  NMEA side-2 / NET-C only\n  NET-S    connector pin, no copper net\nDry contacts UP_COM/UP_NO and DN_COM/DN_NO are not grounded.\nKiCad ERC is not a substitute for the Lofrans wiring check or for thermal sign-off." (at 160 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "cd3aaf24-671a-43a4-9cb3-73eedef2ef18"))
